{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026年Vogue時尚之力盛會《Forces of Fashion》今晚（23日）在蘇州舉行，主題為「絕色」，可惜天公不造美，紅地氈時下起大雨，迪麗熱巴冒着雨行騷，身穿裸色高訂晚裝出場，透視開胸裁剪身材若隱若現，透出東西半球，全場驚艷。</p><p>熱</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:32.312482+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:52:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:33:59.991633+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:33:59.991633+00:00","content_hash":"6f06514ad98d6ece7b34df0ece5eec9ef0e4902d638d61c6c8fdf19ff4ec648b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}